    {
      "id": 3,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Wow, that's great to hear! What inspired you to become a dancer?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T11:13:46.019130+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Oh, that's awesome to hear! I was really inspired by my favorite dancer. You know, she moved so freely and gracefully. She always seemed to have such a unique presence. It definitely got me thinking about trying something myself.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T11:14:07.901769+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Wow, that's awesome to hear! I love her dance style and grace.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T11:15:13.648294+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Thank you for sharing, Emily! Your enthusiasm is truly inspiring. It's always a pleasure to learn from your experiences and see how they have shaped your dance style.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T11:16:10.293708+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Thank you for your kind words and for sharing that with me. I'm really inspired by how you saw yourself in her dance style. It makes me wonder, what would it feel like to glide across the stage with such freedom and grace?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T11:17:11.119179+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
